        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11000' id='943' type-v2='text' w='51591' x='227' y='79111'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>*Vendor funded incentives (VFI) include basket incentives (not free delivery)such as vouchers, discounts and joker discounts from restos + other 3rd parties such as banks etc.

**Incentive depth KPIs are calculated for orders with incentives only
***Orders which have delivery fee amount 0 or no delivery fee is  assigned to the order
****Since GMV is calculated after incentives, the nominator here is Avg. Basket Value, not including DF.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
